{"title":"Wolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 2 Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (0.8% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/wolf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/wolf?lv=2\">Lv 2 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/wolf?lv=3\">Lv 3 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/wolf?lv=4\">Lv 4 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/wolf?lv=5\">Lv 5 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/wolf?lv=2\" title=\"Pick level 2\"><td><b>2</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>14</td><td>2.2</td><td>100</td><td class=\"muted\">42 · 3.1 · 300</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Imp%20Tree\">Imp Tree</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/wolf\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>3</b></td><td>16</td><td>3.1</td><td>150</td><td class=\"muted\">48 · 4.3 · 450</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/wolf?lv=4\" title=\"Pick level 4\"><td><b>4</b></td><td>18</td><td>4</td><td>200</td><td class=\"muted\">54 · 5.6 · 600</td><td>4</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/wolf?lv=5\" title=\"Pick level 5\"><td><b>5</b></td><td>20</td><td>5.1</td><td>250</td><td class=\"muted\">60 · 7.1 · 750</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binx%20Crypt\">Binx Crypt</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"wolf\" data-map-level=\"3\">Show level 3 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 5 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wolf-pelt\" title=\"Wolf Pelt - in 60% of 5 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 8 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a24a0ceb9eeabaa06889.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">60% · 3/5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 60% of 5 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">60% · 3/5</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n    